 editor seems to \"hang\" for a few seconds, ie not responding to buttons.\n\nThis only happens with the Forward+ renderer. If I change it to Mobile or Compatibility it behaves normally, but Compatibility mode causes a drastic drop in performance.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun my game from the Godot editor then quit the game (eg by closing the window, but it also crashes when in full-screen mode).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIs this compulsory? I don't have an MRP at the moment, because my game was well into development before this bug appeared. I might be able to generate a more minimal reproducer after experimenting with git bisect, if this is necessary.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104922/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}